config EXAMPLES_HEALTH_MONITOR
	bool "Health monitor validation example"
	default n
	depends on HEALTH_MONITOR && !DISABLE_PTHREAD && !DISABLE_MQUEUE
	---help---
		Enable the health_monitor command for start, kick and stop through a
		worker thread, a periodic run cycle, a two-thread scenario and
		intentional timeout testing. No thread is monitored until a command
		explicitly starts monitoring. The expire command deliberately triggers
		PANIC; reset behavior follows the board watchdog and panic configuration.
